('01k4t272gw3zj7qk870env20ks','Kade','Jaskolski','albina22@example.org','+1-978-612-1212',NULL,'1000+','Business Operations Specialist','Support needed for your product','I\'m experiencing an issue with accessing my data. I\'ve tried restarting and clearing my cache but it\'s still not working. Can someone from your technical team help me resolve this?\n\nThank you,\nCharlie Watsica','closed','RE: Support needed for your product','Thank you for reaching out about this issue. Based on your description, I recommend trying the following steps:\n\n1. Clear your browser cache\n2. Ensure you\'re using a supported browser version\n3. Try logging out and back in\n\nIf you\'re still experiencing problems after trying these steps, please let me know and I\'ll escalate this to our technical team.','2025-09-10 18:13:10','db5e18be-f2b7-48f1-8a88-984a0c0b8f09','2025-09-09 07:13:10','2025-09-10 07:59:28',NULL,'169.165.116.77','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; PPC Mac OS X 10_5_0 rv:2.0) Gecko/20130804 Firefox/36.0','{\"device\": null, \"source\": \"referral\", \"referrer\": \"https://www.customer.com\", \"timestamp\": 1757427190, \"utm_medium\": \"cpc\", \"utm_source\": \"customer\", \"utm_campaign\": null, \"page_view_count\": 9, \"form_completion_time\": 221}'),
